stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> REGISTERED : Intake scan
    REGISTERED --> SORTED : Recipient matched
    REGISTERED --> UNIDENTIFIED : Recipient unmatched
    UNIDENTIFIED --> SORTED : Manual triage

    SORTED --> STORED : Shelf allocated
    STORED --> READY_FOR_PICKUP : Package placed on shelf
    READY_FOR_PICKUP --> PICKUP_REQUESTED : Learner generates code
    READY_FOR_PICKUP --> OVERDUE : > 48 hours uncollected

    PICKUP_REQUESTED --> READY_FOR_PICKUP : Code expired (30m)
    PICKUP_REQUESTED --> COLLECTED : Security verifies code
    OVERDUE --> RETURNED : Return to courier

    COLLECTED --> [*]
    RETURNED --> [*]
